{"code":"007770","name":"한일화학","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"화학","sector_desc":"석유화학·정밀화학·2차전지 소재 등. 유가, 중국 수요, 스프레드(제품가−원료가)가 실적을 좌우합니다.","desc":"동사는 1972년 설립된 아연화 전문 제조기업으로, 1992년 코스닥에 상장했으며, 현재 3개의 비상장 종속회사를 보유하고 있음. 아연화, 도료, 재활용플라스틱 제조부문 3개 체제로 운영되며, 아연화는 타이어, 자동차용 고무제품, 페라이트 산업의 원재료로 활용됨. 도료 사업은 특수 도료를 제조·판매하고, 재활용플라스틱 부문은 폐플라스틱을 재생 원료로 전환하는 사업을 하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-27","n_days":299,"close":7890.0,"open":7980.0,"high":8000.0,"low":7450.0,"volume":772,"amount":6091080.0,"ret_1d":0.6378,"gap":1.7857,"range_pct":6.9708,"ret_5":3.8158,"ret_20":2.6008,"ret_60":21.0123,"ret_120":0.7663,"ret_250":-12.1381,"ma20":7832.0,"ma60":7560.6667,"ma120":7330.1667,"ma200":7562.3,"close_vs_ma200":4.3333,"close_vs_ma60":4.3559,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":1.0,"slope_60":145.645,"r2_60":0.4989,"slope_120":20.6078,"r2_120":0.0934,"slope_250":-14.3601,"r2_250":0.296,"high52":9070.0,"low52":6010.0,"pos_52w":61.4379,"dd_52w":-13.0099,"mdd_1y":-30.303,"atr14_pct":6.3779,"vol_ann_60":42.6577,"vol_avg20":1230.65,"vol_ratio20":0.6273,"vr5":0.645,"vr20":0.3097,"amount_avg5":15822498.0,"amount_avg20":9695342.0,"amount_avg60":23665217.3333,"obv_chg20":18.409,"turnover_20":0.7012,"pv_eff_20":3.7089,"rsi14":51.6271,"frgn_net_5":395.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0113,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0113,"frgn_net_20":566.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0161,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0161,"frgn_net_60":-81.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.0023,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.0023,"frgn_net_120":-6984.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.199,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":-0.199,"foreign_ratio":2.39,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.05,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":15.0,"op_margin_q":3.9164,"op_qoq":287.5,"op_turnaround":1.0,"op_yoy":153.5714,"rev_yoy":22.3642,"op_trend_4q":87.4725,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-12.9,"debt_ratio":56.44,"per":null,"pbr":0.31,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":2.39,"target_price":nul